.TH VALIDATE-AUTHORING-CONTRACT 1 "2026-09-05" "AgentOperationsCockpit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
validate-authoring-contract \- additiven META-LH-03-Vertrag pruefen
.br
validate the additive META-LH-03 contract
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B validate-authoring-contract.sh
.BI --repo " PATH"
.RI [ --json ]
.PP
.B validate-authoring-contract.ps1
.BI -Repo " PATH"
.RI [ -Json ]
.SH BESCHREIBUNG / DESCRIPTION
Prueft read-only die Ancestry des unveraenderlichen Reparatur-Checkpoints,
seinen exakten Tree und alle 48 geordneten Pfad-Rohhashes. Das spaeter
erstellte Manifest wird nicht im frueheren Reparatur-Commit erwartet.
Anschliessend prueft der Validator genau ein erneuertes META-LH-03-Blatt,
13 unveraenderte Blaetter und die unveraenderte abgeschlossene Series-Bruecke.
.PP
Read-only validation proves the immutable repair checkpoint ancestry, its
exact tree, and all 48 ordered path raw hashes. The later manifest is not
expected in the earlier repair commit. The validator then verifies exactly one
renewed META-LH-03 leaf, 13 unchanged leaves, and the unchanged completed
Series bridge.
.PP
Die Oberflaechen werten keine Quelldaten durch eine Shell aus, schreiben keine
Datei und erteilen keine Remote-, Merge-, Bypass-, Level-0- oder
Preset-Promotionsautoritaet. / The surfaces do not shell-evaluate source data,
write no file, and grant no remote, merge, bypass, Level 0, or preset-promotion
authority.
.SH OPTIONEN / OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --repo " " PATH , " " -Repo " " PATH
Repository-Wurzel. / Repository root.
.TP
.BR --json , " " -Json
JSON mit schemaVersion, outcome und Checkpoint-Zusammenfassung. / JSON with
schemaVersion, outcome, and checkpoint summary.
.TP
.BR -h , " " --help
Bash-Hilfe. / Bash help.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Vertrag bestanden. / Contract passed.
.TP
.B 2
Validierungsfehler. / Validation failure.
.TP
.B 64
CLI-Verwendungsfehler. / CLI usage failure.
.SH BEISPIELE / EXAMPLES
.nf
bash specs/003-authoring-contract/contracts/validate-authoring-contract.sh --repo . --json
pwsh -NoProfile -File specs/003-authoring-contract/contracts/validate-authoring-contract.ps1 -Repo . -Json
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR validate-current-evidence-binding (1),
.BR validate-intake-authoring-receipt (1)
